&lt;h2 class=&quot;col-sm-9 col-12 content&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/FqKyxNx.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;300&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;col-sm-9 col-12 content&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;PayPay India&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;col-sm-9 col-12 content&quot;&gt;PayPay, a fintech company providing a service enjoyed by over 75 million users since its launch in 2018 in Japan. The company is now home to a very diverse team of members from more than 50 countries. We grew to a team of several thousand employees in Japan but are far from over. We are still in the Day 1. Every day, new members join us from all over the world to create new value and deliver it to society.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;col-sm-9 col-12 content&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
